<title>USA: Belmont Bancorp yr net rises.</title>
<headline>Belmont Bancorp yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. CLAIRSVILLE, Ohio 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.46		    $1.95</p>
<p> Net shr		     2.34		     1.95</p>
<p> Net			  5,002		    4,206</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 net share includes a pre-tax charge in Q3 of $397,000 as its assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $333.9 million versus $317.3 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
